  "notes": "{放|はな}つ covers three related ideas: releasing something, firing a projectile, and emitting light or smell. It has a literary or dramatic tone compared to everyday alternatives.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{放|はな}つ\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{放|はな}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates an ongoing state of emission: ⟦{光|ひかり}→光：01707_hikari⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{放|はな}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (is emitting light).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{矢|や}→矢：10461_ya⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{放|はな}つ (shoot an arrow)\n- ⟦{光|ひかり}→光：01707_hikari⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{放|はな}つ (emit light)\n- ⟦{香|かお}り→香り：00189_kaori⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{放|はな}つ (give off a fragrance)\n- ⟦{野|の}→野：03535_no⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{放|はな}つ (release into the wild)\n- {異彩|いさい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{放|はな}つ (stand out, be distinctive)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{放|はな}す→放す：29986_hanasu⟧: to release, let go (everyday, physical release)\n- {放|はな}つ: to release, emit (literary, broader range including light/arrows)",
